(7640569, 1240589, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and treatment, but the skewed line from being shot to the right of center is killing my OCD.</td>', 'Nice idea and treatment, but the skewed line from being shot to the right of center is killing my OCD.', '2019-09-05 12:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7640570, 1240295, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice idea just killed by the squashing of vertical images here. I''m guessing it has much greater impact on a screen where it is the same projected size as the horizontal crops.</td>', 'Nice idea just killed by the squashing of vertical images here. I''m guessing it has much greater impact on a screen where it is the same projected size as the horizontal crops.', '2019-09-05 12:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7640572, 1240656, 156466, '<td valign="top">Like it but not the power lines.</td>', 'Like it but not the power lines.', '2019-09-05 12:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7640576, 1240377, 156466, '<td valign="top">-1 for the crooked horizon, -1 for the off balance composition. Otherwise really nice.</td>', '-1 for the crooked horizon, -1 for the off balance composition. Otherwise really nice.', '2019-09-05 12:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7640727, 1240377, 141826, '<td valign="top">Amaaaaaaaaaazing shot and processing...<br/>10++</td>', 'Amaaaaaaaaaazing shot and processing...10++', '2019-09-06 08:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7640765, 1240514, 173844, '<td valign="top">Half-open eyes, am I still dreaming?  It''s that moment of doubt that''s so appealing here.  The mid-line at 120 adds to the unreality, as do the protruding rocks in the lake echoing the mountains. And then there''s the pseudo-dynamism of the rocks as a pod of dolphins, with an attendant whale and other beasts.  Beautiful subtle range of tones and detail, befitting a superior black and white.  "The Lake"  Here''s proof that a simple, straight-forward title often affords greater resonance than one more prolonged.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Half-open eyes, am I still dreaming?  It''s that moment of doubt that''s so appealing here.  The mid-line at 120 adds to the unreality, as do the protruding rocks in the lake echoing the mountains. And then there''s the pseudo-dynamism of the rocks as a pod of dolphins, with an attendant whale and other beasts.  Beautiful subtle range of tones and detail, befitting a superior black and white.  "The Lake"  Here''s proof that a simple, straight-forward title often affords greater resonance than one more prolonged.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2019-09-06 17:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7640770, 1240560, 173844, '<td valign="top">This is terrific.  So minimal yet exciting, fun and mischievous.  I think many, if not most, of us would thrill to a downhill dash.  I admire how eloquent the lines are.  I like how the man is placed, and how one''s imagination can infer the upper and lower expanses.  Perfect in black and white.</td>', 'This is terrific.  So minimal yet exciting, fun and mischievous.  I think many, if not most, of us would thrill to a downhill dash.  I admire how eloquent the lines are.  I like how the man is placed, and how one''s imagination can infer the upper and lower expanses.  Perfect in black and white.', '2019-09-06 18:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7640772, 1240641, 173844, '<td valign="top">This image is so expansive my eyeballs are going in different directions at once.  It''s like a deep breath.  It''s airy, like a watercolor.  The left and right fifths are less interesting than the center, but their inclusion is what gives breadth.  A seven course feast.  Really nice.</td>', 'This image is so expansive my eyeballs are going in different directions at once.  It''s like a deep breath.  It''s airy, like a watercolor.  The left and right fifths are less interesting than the center, but their inclusion is what gives breadth.  A seven course feast.  Really nice.', '2019-09-06 18:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7640774, 1240208, 173844, '<td valign="top">That plaintive yet delicious feeling close upon nightfall.  This  lovely image brings on a cascade of remembered sensations, sweet and hopefully to be revisited in our future days.  The trains are solidly present and stretch on around the curves, especially the black-purple one in the foreground.  The sunset colors give grandeur to the entire yard.  Just in case it doesn''t live on in my memory, I''m plunking it into my favorites.</td>', 'That plaintive yet delicious feeling close upon nightfall.  This  lovely image brings on a cascade of remembered sensations, sweet and hopefully to be revisited in our future days.  The trains are solidly present and stretch on around the curves, especially the black-purple one in the foreground.  The sunset colors give grandeur to the entire yard.  Just in case it doesn''t live on in my memory, I''m plunking it into my favorites.', '2019-09-06 19:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7640813, 1240361, 42495, '<td valign="top">Very nice. St. Joe in MI?</td>', 'Very nice. St. Joe in MI?', '2019-09-07 14:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
