(7641037, 1240345, 96574, '<td valign="top">Great use of the high-aspect ratio.  One of my two top scorers.</td>', 'Great use of the high-aspect ratio.  One of my two top scorers.', '2019-09-10 01:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641038, 1240208, 96574, '<td valign="top">Love the warm sunrise/sunset colors.  One of my two favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'Love the warm sunrise/sunset colors.  One of my two favorites in the challenge.', '2019-09-10 01:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641049, 1240377, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely panorama of Manhattan, yet much more.  The overall amber/golden tone implies, to me, ambivalence.  The city is both dark and golden, shot through with shadows and insistent sunlight.  The inflowing blue sky, as always, offers promise and redemption.  I like the Freedom Tower''s head in the clouds, and the glittering Hudson River.  A deeper, layered view of the city.<br/>Great title.</td>', 'Lovely panorama of Manhattan, yet much more.  The overall amber/golden tone implies, to me, ambivalence.  The city is both dark and golden, shot through with shadows and insistent sunlight.  The inflowing blue sky, as always, offers promise and redemption.  I like the Freedom Tower''s head in the clouds, and the glittering Hudson River.  A deeper, layered view of the city.Great title.', '2019-09-10 09:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641050, 1240233, 173844, '<td valign="top">Charming, bucolic scene.  Even deeper than it is wide.  When fog fills the valley like this enchantment visits the world.  Time stops and you marvel at the benevolence of life.  Reminiscent of Chinese scrolls.  Beautifully handled delicate tones.  Nicely framed by the foreground trees.  Fine title.  It''s a privilege to be here.  Thank you.</td>', 'Charming, bucolic scene.  Even deeper than it is wide.  When fog fills the valley like this enchantment visits the world.  Time stops and you marvel at the benevolence of life.  Reminiscent of Chinese scrolls.  Beautifully handled delicate tones.  Nicely framed by the foreground trees.  Fine title.  It''s a privilege to be here.  Thank you.', '2019-09-10 09:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641051, 1240345, 173844, '<td valign="top">Deep blue verging into purple, gets me every time.  That''s a lovely background for the connected line of poles that diminishes slightly in height in reaching the lighthouse.  The repetition is mesmerizing, then a sparkling reward at the end, an exclamation point!  Appealing.<br/>Personal second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Deep blue verging into purple, gets me every time.  That''s a lovely background for the connected line of poles that diminishes slightly in height in reaching the lighthouse.  The repetition is mesmerizing, then a sparkling reward at the end, an exclamation point!  Appealing.Personal second favorite of the challenge.', '2019-09-10 09:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641052, 1240619, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely study.  Beautiful light and silhouettes.  I loves how the perspective offers a coy glimpse of the water.  A quiet, perfect moment.</td>', 'Lovely study.  Beautiful light and silhouettes.  I loves how the perspective offers a coy glimpse of the water.  A quiet, perfect moment.', '2019-09-10 09:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641054, 1240612, 173844, '<td valign="top">Such an interesting image.  The apparent verticality is actually a forward reach.  The blocks of shapes in muted palette are straightforward and daring.  It makes you work and then rewards as you put it back together and smile.  Terrific and unusual use of the format.</td>', 'Such an interesting image.  The apparent verticality is actually a forward reach.  The blocks of shapes in muted palette are straightforward and daring.  It makes you work and then rewards as you put it back together and smile.  Terrific and unusual use of the format.', '2019-09-10 09:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641055, 1240218, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrayal of this bridge.  The sense of distance of the span is only enhanced by the narrow format.  The colors, black, blue and gray, are sturdy and powerful.  The delicate staccato of sky between the lacy ironwork is playfully echoed by the glittering water of the bay.  Good stuff.</td>', 'Wonderful portrayal of this bridge.  The sense of distance of the span is only enhanced by the narrow format.  The colors, black, blue and gray, are sturdy and powerful.  The delicate staccato of sky between the lacy ironwork is playfully echoed by the glittering water of the bay.  Good stuff.', '2019-09-10 09:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641057, 1240209, 173844, '<td valign="top">A Rorschach test in snowy realms for the planet.  I see a clarion call for help.  I''m thinking this is the edge of a glacier.  Though many places have this landscape, it reminds me of Iceland, which we visited last summer.  The lines of the ice mountains play off against the distant mountain skyline, and actually seem more real.  The reflections join in the conversation.  It''s both calm and eerie.  The haziness of the background also feels like commentary.  I guess this sparks a personal line of thought.  It''s a good, provocative image.</td>', 'A Rorschach test in snowy realms for the planet.  I see a clarion call for help.  I''m thinking this is the edge of a glacier.  Though many places have this landscape, it reminds me of Iceland, which we visited last summer.  The lines of the ice mountains play off against the distant mountain skyline, and actually seem more real.  The reflections join in the conversation.  It''s both calm and eerie.  The haziness of the background also feels like commentary.  I guess this sparks a personal line of thought.  It''s a good, provocative image.', '2019-09-10 09:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641063, 1240313, 38032, '<td valign="top">this works well and I''m not even sure why. I guess I have a thing for legs ;)</td>', 'this works well and I''m not even sure why. I guess I have a thing for legs ;)', '2019-09-10 10:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641064, 1240208, 38032, '<td valign="top">great light.</td>', 'great light.', '2019-09-10 10:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641072, 1240191, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautifully handled.  It''s surprising that we very rarely (a first for me) see this perspective on butterflies, for it''s interesting and kind of revelatory.  This is flight. Poised on these purple flowers, we can almost feel the breeze lifting him or her up, lifting us up.  The perspective creates some confusion on the left, but only because we''re so close.  Fine fit for this format.</td>', 'Beautifully handled.  It''s surprising that we very rarely (a first for me) see this perspective on butterflies, for it''s interesting and kind of revelatory.  This is flight. Poised on these purple flowers, we can almost feel the breeze lifting him or her up, lifting us up.  The perspective creates some confusion on the left, but only because we''re so close.  Fine fit for this format.', '2019-09-10 13:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641074, 1240678, 173844, '<td valign="top">One wing happens to be a bit obscured by a flower, but otherwise most impressive.  I''m a fan of using uncluttered space to set a mood, to allow an image to open up in due course.  Here it feels like we''re seeing a movement out of the corner of an eye.  The tone is sumptuous.  It''s totally balanced, for me.  I find myself nodding my head.</td>', 'One wing happens to be a bit obscured by a flower, but otherwise most impressive.  I''m a fan of using uncluttered space to set a mood, to allow an image to open up in due course.  Here it feels like we''re seeing a movement out of the corner of an eye.  The tone is sumptuous.  It''s totally balanced, for me.  I find myself nodding my head.', '2019-09-10 13:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641075, 1240313, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sure looks like a mannequin, yet it''s not 100%.  She fills the space well.  The contrast is terrific.  Very stylish.</td>', 'Sure looks like a mannequin, yet it''s not 100%.  She fills the space well.  The contrast is terrific.  Very stylish.', '2019-09-10 13:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641077, 1240642, 173844, '<td valign="top">A poetic image.  The burnt orange tone conveys heat and dryness, unbounded.  The trees have a nice rhythm.  The grass sparkles under the sun.  The unusual composition works.  The background is barely defined, but majestic.</td>', 'A poetic image.  The burnt orange tone conveys heat and dryness, unbounded.  The trees have a nice rhythm.  The grass sparkles under the sun.  The unusual composition works.  The background is barely defined, but majestic.', '2019-09-10 14:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641079, 1240648, 173844, '<td valign="top">The grace of the tendrils and the transitioning pink and blue of the sky set a lovely scene, but it''s the beautiful color, detail and position of the morning glory that fully delivers.  It seems to be longing, striving.  The framing of the tendrils puts her, if I may, on stage, delicate and contained before the audience.  Nice.</td>', 'The grace of the tendrils and the transitioning pink and blue of the sky set a lovely scene, but it''s the beautiful color, detail and position of the morning glory that fully delivers.  It seems to be longing, striving.  The framing of the tendrils puts her, if I may, on stage, delicate and contained before the audience.  Nice.', '2019-09-10 14:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641081, 1240651, 173844, '<td valign="top">An image of leaves against a blanched sky doesn''t sound noteworthy, but this is pleasantly entrancing.  The colors are appealing.  Not sure what''s going on to the right, but it''s interesting.</td>', 'An image of leaves against a blanched sky doesn''t sound noteworthy, but this is pleasantly entrancing.  The colors are appealing.  Not sure what''s going on to the right, but it''s interesting.', '2019-09-10 14:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641082, 1240183, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely view at this marvelous time of day.</td>', 'Lovely view at this marvelous time of day.', '2019-09-10 14:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641083, 1240664, 173844, '<td valign="top">Not sure why this works for me, but it does.  Perhaps it''s the disconcerting slant, or the woman''s position.  Is she sleeping or tired or in pain?  Does her walker, if it''s hers, explain everything?  Is there a symbolic connection between her and the machine in the center background?  I''m curious about the story.  I like the unpretentious ordinariness of the scene.  It holds the attention and leaves one incomplete.</td>', 'Not sure why this works for me, but it does.  Perhaps it''s the disconcerting slant, or the woman''s position.  Is she sleeping or tired or in pain?  Does her walker, if it''s hers, explain everything?  Is there a symbolic connection between her and the machine in the center background?  I''m curious about the story.  I like the unpretentious ordinariness of the scene.  It holds the attention and leaves one incomplete.', '2019-09-10 14:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641084, 1240645, 173844, '<td valign="top">I can hardly concentrate on the scene for the pretty vertical shapes.  It''s like a bouquet in the vase of life.  Fine use of the format.  Busy and charming.</td>', 'I can hardly concentrate on the scene for the pretty vertical shapes.  It''s like a bouquet in the vase of life.  Fine use of the format.  Busy and charming.', '2019-09-10 14:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641085, 1240666, 173844, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t fit the intention of a long, narrow rectangle, but it''s a wonderful image.</td>', 'Doesn''t fit the intention of a long, narrow rectangle, but it''s a wonderful image.', '2019-09-10 14:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641094, 1240377, 149964, '<td valign="top">This is fabulous. Love the composition colours and mood. Top five.,</td>', 'This is fabulous. Love the composition colours and mood. Top five.,', '2019-09-10 16:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641095, 1240191, 149964, '<td valign="top">What an amazing perspective. In my top five.</td>', 'What an amazing perspective. In my top five.', '2019-09-10 16:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7641099, 1240183, 149964, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours to support an amazing view.</td>', 'Beautiful colours to support an amazing view.', '2019-09-10 16:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
